{"id":"00588","root":"uni00588_1","name":{"ja":"ブリジット","en":"Brigitte"},"title":{"ja":"【花嫁妖狐】","en":"【Fox Bride】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【花嫁妖狐】 ブリジット","en":"【Fox Bride】 Brigitte"},"aliases":["Bridget"],"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2022-05-31","limited":true,"characterId":48,"profile":{"ja":"魔界の氷雪地帯で狩りをして暮らす狐の獣人の一族で、人間界では妖狐と呼ばれる種族の娘。見た目は人間に近いが、頭には尖った耳、お尻にはふわふわの尻尾がはえている。警戒心は強いが、人や魔族には慣れやすく、一度慣れると犬猫のように懐いてしまう。ブリジットは族長の娘で、無邪気で幼い性格からひょいひょい色々なところに行ってはいろんな経験を積み、狩りをして土産を持って帰ってくる。最近では魔界での狩りに飽きたようで、人間界に行っては色々と学んでいる。戦闘の時は巨大な獣に変化し相手をかみ殺すが、人型の時は人間に毛がはえた程度の強さである。仕事の為に花嫁衣装を身に付けたブリジットだが、ひと段落したら、好きな人に想いを伝えられたらいいな、とウキウキのようだ。","en":"Brigitte is a fox beast-person from a tribe that lives hunting in the icy snowfields of the Demon Realm, known as yōko in the Human Realm. She looks almost human but has pointed ears and a fluffy tail. She's wary at first, but once she gets used to people or demons she becomes as affectionate as a dog or cat. As the chieftain's daughter, she's innocent and childlike, darting about, gaining experience, and bringing back trophies. Bored with Demon Realm hunts, she now travels the Human Realm to learn new things. In battle she can transform into a gigantic beast to bite foes, while in human form she's as strong as a human covered in fur. Wearing a bridal outfit for work, she's excited at the thought of someday confessing her feelings to someone she likes."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"星空ユメ","forms":[{"id":"uni00588_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1108,2216],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[142,284],"def":[128,256],"spd":[66,66],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["2","1500001"],"evolve":[["evo00004",5],["evo00005",15],["evo00006",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00588_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1716,3432],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[219,438],"def":[191,382],"spd":[66,66],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["2","1500001","1500002"],"evolve":[["evo